{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770950/extras/Out_on_the_Water_GIF1_resize.gif?t=1748393288\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770950/extras/About_This_Game_Section_Banners__1_.png?t=1748393288\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Out On The Water is a short, single-player, narrative-focused fishing game. Experience the story of a man in between life and death struggling to remember his past. Catch fish, upgrade your fishing rod, and regain your memories to try and return to the world you can't quite remember.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770950/extras/About_This_Game_Section_Banners__1__copy.png?t=1748393288\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy a short narrative about navigating through the afterlife</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Catch fish to regain your memories</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your fishing rod to make fish easier to catch</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A fishing mechanic where you manage your stamina to catch fish</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3770950?t=1748393288","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3770950?t=1748393288","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770950